-- Canonical world topology (see world-topology.js). The territory/neighbor rows below are
-- generated by backend/topology-sql.js -- never hand-edit them here. To regenerate after
-- changing world-topology.js, run: node scripts/generate-world-seed.js
-- Structure: capital -> home ring (3) -> frontier ring (3), identical and rotated 120
-- degrees for blue/red/green, plus 3 contested border zones (one per faction pair) and a
-- shared central core equidistant from all three capitals. This file intentionally never
-- removes player accounts, their buildings, or progress: world seeding must never be able
-- to wipe them out.


